id: footwork
name: Footwork
talentCategory: mobility
prerequisites: Agility Score of 4+
description: >
  Your deft footwork allows you to close the gap between you and your target, even as they try to flee.
text: >
  Footwork: Your deft footwork allows you to close the gap between you and your target, even as they try to flee.
  –Prerequisites: Agility Score of 4+
  (1)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may move up to 1(bT) Squares in any direction.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Rapid Movement effect of the Movement Maneuver, increase your Defense Value by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When a Character within your Melee Range uses the Movement Maneuver to leave your Melee Range, you may use the Movement Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, their Movement does not trigger your Exploit Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Its own Maneuver, on the Maneuvers tab (maneuvers/footwork-first-effect.dbu).
# (3) A Movement used by one within your Melee Range: the Movement offered on its card out of sequence beside your Exploit -
# taking it closes the Exploit; once a Round (chat.mjs offerExploits).
allow footwork.follow;

# (2) Rapid Movement taken, once a Round - Footwork (a mark), Defense Value 1(T) till the start of your next turn. Its
# Triggered/Automatic button (the user's); set Triggered, asked in a window (use-maneuver.mjs takeRapidMovement).
[triggered/rapid-movement, 1/round, effect 2]
gain(footwork-mark);
expires(footwork-mark, start-of-next-turn);
